        "content": "{\"formal\": {\"statement\": \"∀ (q : ℕ)\\n(Nq : ℕ)\\n(hNqpos : 0 < Nq)\\n(qodd : Odd q)\\n(qpos : q > 0)\\n(hNq : Nq = {a : ℕ | 0 < a ∧ a < (q : ℝ) / 4 ∧ Nat.gcd a q = 1}.encard), Odd Nq ↔ ∃ p k : ℕ, q = p ^ k ∧ k > 0 ∧ p.Prime ∧ (p % 8 = 5 ∨ p % 8 = 7)\", \"namespace\": \"\", \"supporting_declarations\": [], \"rendered\": \"∀ (q Nq : ℕ),\\n  ((0 < Nq) →\\n    ((Odd q) →\\n      ((q > 0) →\\n        ((↑Nq = {a | ((0 < a) ∧ ((↑a < (↑q / 4)) ∧ ((a.gcd q) = 1)))}.encard) →\\n          ((Odd Nq) ↔ (∃ p k, ((q = (p ^ k)) ∧ ((k > 0) ∧ ((Nat.Prime p) ∧ (((p % 8) = 5) ∨ ((p % 8) = 7)))))))))))\"}, \"signature\": \"(q : ℕ)\\n(Nq : ℕ)\\n(hNqpos : 0 < Nq)\\n(qodd : Odd q)\\n(qpos : q > 0)\\n(hNq : Nq = {a : ℕ | 0 < a ∧ a < (q : ℝ) / 4 ∧ Nat.gcd a q = 1}.encard)\\n: Odd Nq ↔ ∃ p k : ℕ, q = p ^ k ∧ k > 0 ∧ p.Prime ∧ (p % 8 = 5 ∨ p % 8 = 7)\", \"informal\": \"Let $q$ be an odd positive integer, and let $N_q$ denote the number of integers $a$ such that $0<a<q/4$ and $\\\\gcd(a,q)=1$. Show that $N_q$ is odd if and only if $q$ is of the form $p^k$ with $k$ a positive integer and $p$ a prime congruent to $5$ or $7$ modulo $8$.\", \"docstring\": \"/--\\nLet $q$ be an odd positive integer, and let $N_q$ denote the number of integers $a$ such that $0< a< q/4$ and $\\\\gcd(a,q)=1$. Show that $N_q$ is odd if and only if $q$ is of the form $p^k$ with $k$ a positive integer and $p$ a prime congruent to $5$ or $7$ modulo $8$.\\n-/\", \"prechecks\": {\"status\": \"completed\", \"hints\": [{\"kind\": \"natural_arithmetic_review\", \"status\": \"advisory\"}, {\"kind\": \"division_review\", \"status\": \"advisory\"}], \"vacuity\": \"unresolved\"}, \"advisory\": {\"paraphrase_status\": \"completed\", \"differences\": [], \"paraphrase\": \"For every natural number q, let Nq denote the cardinality of the set {a ∈ ℕ | 0 < a < q/4 ∧ gcd(a, q) = 1}. Then, Nq is odd if and only if there exist natural numbers p and k, with k > 0, such that q = p^k, p is prime, and p modulo 8 is either 5 or 7.\", \"comparison_status\": \"truncated\"}}"
